    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15667" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ē-mŏlo</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>,
